674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SADJZXzZNRoQ7kNvwGo0JvC&_nc_oc=AdoKnesdpIjxrGLrffkqfKdCNYjC8h4Sy6oBxQp4IHL-edwpS7DMI6O41kbWLs6Vt5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHHpW8ftLFIb8BxQrIKqldb6HOa1vJkdyTyf09ipQKdYQ&oe=6A79E0D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EWaLfMEohGsQ7kNvwErJvdH&_nc_oc=Adp7U3Sm4d1Tkmd5rUdKgil9jl29UUbslvL3VFgFtWgVElPPC_8RwCUepccHQiknlnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHW0ptFY0weC3d3Effumr-MF35l-f_Vjb9PbFBSseF5zQ&oe=6A79E996"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MfHamM76Y9YQ7kNvwEWj4Ht&_nc_oc=Adp6fmHOHhkLH5kqKGJ6M7OQxdhRN5Uk2E_L_b3ats7CVrioQcPedkN8r_BzMXyUY9c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGpg5jN5NWIP2HXL0nmELI7PLcOj5Xg20CfkyTJcp8xPw&oe=6A79E5B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip